        "id": 55404,
        "name": "Basarin",
        "username": "Basarin",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/b782af/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-31T08:20:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm a bit of both between blind and \"recon\"; while I'll take a good look at what the villains and the environments bring to the party, I won't look up strategies ahead of time and I'll just choose some heroes at random and go for it. if you lose, at least you learned something from it. If you win, it's that much more awesome.</p>",
