        "id": 55405,
        "name": "Braithwhite",
        "username": "Braithwhite",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/braithwhite/{size}/1854_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-01T22:38:17.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>As soon as I get the cards I have to look through them to try and piece together the ongoing story and find new and exciting clues as to the next heroes/villains/etc.&nbsp; And see if any of my guesses or wild theories were correct.</p><p>I generally don't pay to much atention to the mechanics while doing this, though, so its still easy to get surprised!&nbsp;</p>",
